(*
version 1.0	3 nov 2007
programmer 	hugo
tested by	tobias

parset2 selects on of 4 parameter sets depending on the value of X. if TC is specified, the change of the outputs
is ramped by the time TC
*)
FUNCTION_BLOCK PARSET2
VAR_INPUT
