This function increments the input X by the value D and compares the result with U.
if the output exceeds U it will continue to count from L again.

*)
FUNCTION INC2 : INT
VAR_INPUT
	X : INT;
	D : INT;
	L : INT;
	U : INT;
END_VAR
VAR
	tmp: INT;
END_VAR
tmp := U - L + 1;
INC2 := (X + D - L + tmp) MOD tmp + L;



